<title>USA: DSP, Proxim call off merger.</title>
<headline>DSP, Proxim call off merger.</headline>
<dateline>CUPERTINO, Calif 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>DSP Communications Inc and Proxim Inc said on Friday they had mutually agreed to terminate the planned merger of the two companies.</p>
</text>
